sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant RAN as RAN / Open5GS
    participant INGEST as Ingestion Node
    participant LSTM as LSTM Autoencoder
    participant CLASS as Anomaly Classifier
    participant ENGINE as Action Engine
    participant TWIN as Digital Twin
    participant E2 as E2 RC Client

    RAN->>INGEST: Stream KPI Vector (e.g., JSONL / Prom)
    INGEST->>LSTM: Buffered Sequence [T-seq_len : T]
    
    rect rgb(255, 235, 238)
        LSTM->>LSTM: Calculate MSE Reconstruction Error
        LSTM-->>CLASS: Error > Threshold (Anomaly Detected)
    end
    
    CLASS->>CLASS: Extract Attention Weights
    CLASS-->>ENGINE: AnomalyType (e.g., CONGESTION)
    
    ENGINE->>ENGINE: Lookup Candidate Action
    ENGINE->>TWIN: Validate Action (e.g., Admission Control)
    
    rect rgb(243, 229, 245)
        TWIN->>TWIN: Simulate state + proposed action
        TWIN-->>ENGINE: Return Impact Risk Score (e.g., 0.15)
    end
    
    alt Risk < DT_APPROVAL_THRESHOLD
        ENGINE->>E2: Dispatch Safe Action
        E2->>RAN: Execute E2 RC Control (e.g. Reject threshold = 20%)
    else Risk >= DT_APPROVAL_THRESHOLD
        ENGINE-->>ENGINE: Abort Action (Too Risky)
    end
